+/// WHEN THIS GUARDIAN SAW AN INCOMING CONTRACT FUNDED, in unix milliseconds by
+/// its own clock, AND THE CONTRACT. Its decryption share is made and served
+/// only `FM_LNV2_INCOMING_HOLD_SECS` after this - a round's objection window -
+/// so the gateway cannot settle the payer's HTLC before the window has closed.
+/// The contract is kept here because a receiver's claim removes it from
+/// `IncomingContractKey`: measured, a claim inside the hold left the share
+/// endpoint nothing to make a share from, and the gateway never settled.
